{"sections":[{"slug":"高阶可表现范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"高阶可表现范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶可表现范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"高阶可表现范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">高阶可表现范畴又称可表现</span> $(\\infty ,n)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">粗略地说</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">忽略所有基数大小问题</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">高阶可表现范畴的定义是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">取模范畴</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">操作的迭代</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于可表现</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal M$, <span lang=\"zh\">可定义其</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">在余完备范畴的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}_{\\mathrm{cocomp}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>) “<span lang=\"zh\">模范畴</span>” $\\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathcal M)$. “<span lang=\"zh\">可表现</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的范畴</span>” $n\\mathsf{Pr}$ <span lang=\"zh\">由下式归纳定义</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$1\\mathsf{Pr} = \\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathsf{Ani}) = \\mathsf{Pr}$,</li>\n<li>$n\\mathsf{Pr} = \\mathsf{Mod}((n-1)\\mathsf{Pr})$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">按上述方法定义的范畴</span> $n\\mathsf{Pr}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(\\infty ,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但可以升级为</span> $(\\infty ,n+1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/StefanichHigherQCoh","text":"Stefanich"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}